---
import Layout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContactForm from '../components/ContactForm.astro';
import {site} from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="About Us - Website Designers for UK Trades" description="We build simple, professional websites for UK trades. Designed to help you stand out, build trust and get more calls, quotes and jobs." path="/about-us/">
<section class="legacy-hero legacy-about">
  <svg class="legacy-wave" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 1440 900" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path fill="#FF8C42" d="M0,0 H1440 V900 H1415 C1190,680 989,329 819,198 C766,160 727,151 696,165 C596,224 554,337 450,350 C260,390 124,590 0,875 Z"/></svg>
  <div class="container legacy-about-grid">
    <div class="legacy-about-copy"><h1>ABOUT UK TRADE<br/>WEBSITES</h1><h2>We’ve actually built and scaled service businesses ourselves.</h2>
      <a class="btn legacy-pill" href={site.whatsapp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp Us</a>
      <div class="legacy-down" aria-hidden="true">⬇</div></div>
    <figure class="legacy-portrait"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/9d652a95-7af2-4266-92f5-26ca7c434929.jpg" alt="Jordan and Mikie, the team behind UK Trade Websites" width="768" height="1024" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption>Jordan &amp; Mikie</figcaption></figure>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section"><div class="container split-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Where it all started</p><h2>Window cleaning was where it began.</h2><p>At its peak we grew our round to around 1,000 customers while working just three days a week. Alongside that we ran photography, office cleaning, home cleaning rounds and various other services.</p><p>Like most trades, we learned quickly that systems, good marketing and a professional image make all the difference.</p></div><div class="feature-panel"><h2>We know what works for trades</h2><p>Having built service businesses ourselves, we understand that a website needs to be clear, trustworthy and easy for customers to use.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-light"><div class="container split-grid"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Winter-Window-cleaning.jpg" alt="Window cleaning work in winter" width="768" height="520" loading="lazy"/><div><h2>What We Believe</h2><p>When we started building websites for our own businesses, we made plenty of mistakes at first. But over time, we learned what actually works online: simple, fast websites that look professional and help generate enquiries.</p><p>That’s why we created UK Trade Websites. Our goal is to help trade businesses get online quickly with websites that look clean, work properly and help bring in more jobs.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Built For Trades</p><h2>Simple &amp; Professional. Lead Generating.</h2><p>Like any trade, the cheapest option usually isn’t the best — quality and reliability matter.</p></div><div class="card-grid"><article class="info-card"><h3>Why trades trust us</h3><p>We've run service-based businesses ourselves, so we understand how important it is to get consistent work coming in.</p><p>Most trades don't want a complicated website. You want something that looks professional, builds trust and gets the phone ringing.</p></article><article class="info-card"><h3>What makes us different?</h3><p>We specialise in websites for trades and service businesses, not generic template sites.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>What customers expect to see</li><li>What builds trust quickly</li><li>What makes someone pick up the phone</li></ul></article><article class="info-card"><h3>Part of Prunus Media</h3><p>UK Trade Websites is part of Prunus Media, our wider web design and digital marketing agency. The same experience and standards, packaged specifically for trades.</p><p>Some portfolio websites were built through Prunus Media.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-band"><div class="container"><div><h2>Ready for a straightforward website?</h2><p>We’d be glad to help you get online and start generating enquiries.</p></div><a href={site.whatsapp} class="btn btn-accent" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp Us</a></div></section>
<section class="bottom-contact"><div class="container"><ContactForm id="about"/></div></section>
</Layout>
